WEBVTT

01:41.770 --> 01:49.020
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.520 --> 01:51.840
[Episode 22]

02:05.560 --> 02:06.620
You're burning up.

02:07.500 --> 02:09.090
Can't you give me a break?

02:09.680 --> 02:11.610
First a fever, and now a broken leg.

02:12.180 --> 02:12.870
I told you

02:12.910 --> 02:14.360
not to stay up late.

02:14.400 --> 02:15.310
Why didn't you listen?

02:15.310 --> 02:16.510
Tell me what to do now.

02:16.620 --> 02:18.140
How do I explain to our parents? Tell me.

02:18.140 --> 02:19.950
Zeqiu, we're in the hospital.

02:20.160 --> 02:21.860
[Ward Staff Code of Conduct]

02:25.430 --> 02:27.560
And I just sprained and fractured it.

02:28.130 --> 02:29.060
It's not broken.

02:29.780 --> 02:31.560
Can you not tell Mom and Dad?

02:33.210 --> 02:34.560
I promise this won't happen again.

02:34.560 --> 02:35.860
Lie back down.

02:37.340 --> 02:39.780
[Ward Staff Code of Conduct]

02:39.079 --> 02:41.280
It'd be best if you could keep your word.

02:48.270 --> 02:49.800
When will the fever go down?

02:51.079 --> 02:53.010
It should go down after the IV drip.

02:54.020 --> 02:54.990
I need an IV?

03:00.860 --> 03:01.920
She hates needles.

03:04.210 --> 03:04.570
Then,

03:05.580 --> 03:07.440
can she take oral fever medicine?

03:07.930 --> 03:08.350
No.

03:09.340 --> 03:10.590
She's already severely overdrawn.

03:10.590 --> 03:12.640
Oral medication will irritate
her stomach too much.

03:12.640 --> 03:13.260
Besides,

03:13.350 --> 03:15.350
she can sleep well after the IV drip.

03:19.370 --> 03:19.900
Zeqiu...

03:23.310 --> 03:24.170
Jiang Yubai...

03:32.130 --> 03:32.970
It's my fault.

03:33.120 --> 03:35.980
I should have worked overtime
with our team leader.

03:37.150 --> 03:38.210
I should be blamed.

03:38.690 --> 03:41.630
If I didn't keep complaining about
possibly delaying graduation,

03:41.630 --> 03:43.490
she wouldn't have worked so hard.

03:45.160 --> 03:47.620
Why don't we go to the hospital
to see her now?

03:48.290 --> 03:48.840
Enough.

03:49.860 --> 03:52.340
The last thing Zhixia needs right now
is to be bothered.

03:52.340 --> 03:54.000
Her brother is there with her.

03:54.170 --> 03:55.630
If you really want to help,

03:55.660 --> 03:57.990
hurry up and finish the data calculation.

04:05.900 --> 04:06.910
Is there anything else you need?

04:06.910 --> 04:08.040
I'll go buy it later.

04:08.620 --> 04:09.150
No need.

04:09.430 --> 04:12.030
Dr. Shen has bought
all the daily necessities,

04:12.030 --> 04:13.960
and told us to take good care of her.

04:14.350 --> 04:15.080
Don't worry.

04:15.650 --> 04:16.850
I'll get back to work.

04:23.460 --> 04:24.860
What do you want for dinner?

04:24.860 --> 04:25.920
I'll go prepare it.

04:26.580 --> 04:27.580
No need to bother.

04:27.830 --> 04:30.200
The hospital has nutritious meals
for patients.

04:30.200 --> 04:31.730
I've arranged everything.

04:33.680 --> 04:34.780
Thanks for your hard work.

04:34.780 --> 04:36.810
With you here, it saves a lot of trouble.

04:36.810 --> 04:38.140
You're welcome, Zeqiu.

04:38.630 --> 04:40.400
Zeqiu, rest assured.

04:40.750 --> 04:41.810
Go do your own thing.

04:41.810 --> 04:42.930
You still have work.

04:42.930 --> 04:44.180
How can I rest assured?

04:44.180 --> 04:45.780
You can't even get out of bed.

04:46.810 --> 04:47.450
Shall we

04:48.159 --> 04:49.000
hire a caregiver for you?

04:49.000 --> 04:49.500
No need.

04:51.680 --> 04:52.810
I'll always be here.

04:54.920 --> 04:56.190
Shen has work to do, too.

04:56.190 --> 04:57.390
He must be quite busy.

04:57.890 --> 04:59.420
How about I take care of her instead?

04:59.420 --> 05:02.020
My schedule happens to be
quite flexible, too.

05:10.300 --> 05:10.900
Well,

05:11.480 --> 05:12.340
all right then.

05:13.950 --> 05:16.980
I'll leave Lin Zhixia in your hands then.

05:22.160 --> 05:22.480
Jia.

05:25.680 --> 05:28.080
I bought some food and drinks
for everyone.

05:28.120 --> 05:29.160
Thank you, Dr. Shen.

05:29.160 --> 05:30.240
Come and get your milk tea.

05:30.240 --> 05:31.320
Dr. Shen's treat.

05:31.570 --> 05:32.270
So nice.

05:33.930 --> 05:36.250
Dr. Shen,
is there anything you need us for?

05:36.250 --> 05:37.409
You're usually so serious,

05:37.409 --> 05:38.810
you never even talk to us.

05:39.820 --> 05:40.670
Please take

05:40.720 --> 05:42.520
good care of Lin Zhixia in bed 11.

05:44.870 --> 05:47.070
If she needs anything, just let me know.

05:48.950 --> 05:49.880
Dr. Shen,

05:49.950 --> 05:51.550
you are being so thoughtful.

05:51.560 --> 05:53.220
Could she be your girlfriend?

05:53.300 --> 05:54.250
Of course.

05:54.460 --> 05:56.330
Otherwise, how would we be
benefiting from this?

05:56.330 --> 05:57.740
Dr. Shen, does your girlfriend know

05:57.740 --> 05:59.870
that you are so thoughtful toward her?

06:02.980 --> 06:04.400
Dr. Shen, you normally seem so serious,

06:04.400 --> 06:05.500
but you're actually a sweetheart.

06:05.500 --> 06:06.630
Thanks for the help.

06:08.720 --> 06:09.480
I want to drink this.

06:09.480 --> 06:10.420
This one.

06:10.700 --> 06:11.460
This is good.

06:15.930 --> 06:16.530
Director.

06:18.560 --> 06:19.860
I would like to request

06:19.890 --> 06:21.820
to work the night shift for a while.

06:22.860 --> 06:24.390
Do you want to take time off?

06:24.960 --> 06:25.730
No.

06:26.190 --> 06:28.320
I can just work the night shift lately.

06:28.430 --> 06:29.680
If the schedule can't be adjusted,

06:29.680 --> 06:31.210
I can just cover for others.

06:34.030 --> 06:36.630
I heard a friend of yours
is hospitalized here.

06:40.390 --> 06:40.870
Okay.

06:41.659 --> 06:44.060
Then you can cover
the night shifts for now.

06:44.250 --> 06:44.790
But

06:44.820 --> 06:46.480
don't let it affect your work.

06:46.870 --> 06:47.810
Thank you, Director.

06:47.810 --> 06:48.740
You're welcome.

06:51.920 --> 06:53.120
Don't worry, Tingting.

06:53.120 --> 06:54.070
I'm really fine.

06:55.110 --> 06:57.240
I'll be discharged in a couple of days.

06:57.430 --> 06:58.860
Tell Duan Qiyan too.

07:00.090 --> 07:00.690
Got it.

07:01.310 --> 07:01.790
Bye.

07:04.890 --> 07:05.480
These two

07:06.490 --> 07:08.890
have been blowing up
the group chat all day.

07:09.100 --> 07:10.530
It's no big deal anyway.

07:10.620 --> 07:12.150
Everyone is busy with work.

07:12.180 --> 07:13.220
I don't want to bother them.

07:13.220 --> 07:15.180
But what about the school?

07:16.750 --> 07:18.100
While I'm in the hospital,

07:18.100 --> 07:20.100
what will Luo Ying and the others do?

07:20.390 --> 07:22.790
There's still so much to do
for the project.

07:23.060 --> 07:23.990
There's no rush.

07:24.460 --> 07:26.590
Take these two days to sort things out.

07:27.220 --> 07:30.280
Even when rushing,
you need to look where you're going.

07:39.460 --> 07:41.320
Visiting hours have long passed.

07:41.560 --> 07:42.890
The patient needs rest.

07:43.540 --> 07:44.670
Zeqiu already left.

07:45.570 --> 07:46.830
You should go back too.

07:50.500 --> 07:52.130
I'll be so bored.

07:52.870 --> 07:53.600
You won't be.

07:54.180 --> 07:55.180
You need to sleep.

07:58.440 --> 07:59.560
Dr. Shen,

08:00.390 --> 08:02.870
are you always this serious at work?

08:08.690 --> 08:09.380
Today,

08:10.100 --> 08:11.360
I'm on the night shift.

08:16.920 --> 08:17.310
Okay.

08:19.130 --> 08:19.710
Then

08:21.190 --> 08:22.390
I'll head back first.

08:39.610 --> 08:48.140
[Inpatient]

09:22.830 --> 09:28.120
[Inpatient]

09:33.610 --> 09:38.900
[Inpatient]

09:37.870 --> 09:40.070
I still want to check today's progress.

09:40.580 --> 09:42.710
Otherwise, I won't have peace of mind.

09:42.960 --> 09:43.760
Lin Zhixia,

09:44.360 --> 09:46.100
we all know what we need to do.

09:46.420 --> 09:48.270
You also need to know what you should do.

09:48.270 --> 09:50.980
Your top priority right now is to recover.

09:52.130 --> 09:53.980
Don't talk to me about the project
until you're healed.

09:53.980 --> 09:55.710
I won't reply to your messages.

09:55.870 --> 09:56.730
Go to sleep now.

09:57.580 --> 09:57.970
Bye.

10:12.640 --> 10:14.460
You should put your phone down now

10:14.460 --> 10:15.610
and go to sleep.

10:16.300 --> 10:16.960
Good night.

10:18.900 --> 10:19.700
Got it.

10:20.200 --> 10:20.860
Good night.

11:17.660 --> 11:19.950
[Inpatient]

11:20.640 --> 11:22.310
Her eyes are so big.

11:22.790 --> 11:23.720
Did you see that?

11:26.800 --> 11:28.460
What's wrong? What happened?

11:28.870 --> 11:29.670
It's nothing.

11:29.890 --> 11:30.670
Everyone wants to see

11:30.670 --> 11:32.870
what Dr. Shen's girlfriend looks like.

11:33.460 --> 11:34.260
Girlfriend?

11:34.790 --> 11:36.340
She is so elegant.

11:36.740 --> 11:38.380
What a perfect match.

11:38.890 --> 11:41.140
No wonder he was looking for people
to swap shifts with last night.

11:41.140 --> 11:42.410
Looking at this schedule,

11:42.410 --> 11:45.270
he'll probably be staying
at the hospital all week.

11:45.360 --> 11:46.140
Excuse me.

11:46.540 --> 11:47.270
May I ask

11:47.640 --> 11:49.440
where I can borrow a wheelchair?

11:49.460 --> 11:51.590
At the cashier in the outpatient hall.

11:53.000 --> 11:53.600
Thank you.

11:56.290 --> 11:57.220
She's so pretty.

12:09.350 --> 12:10.800
L-L-L-L-Lin Zhixia.

12:11.140 --> 12:12.470
Look what I brought you.

12:13.280 --> 12:15.010
How are you? Did you sleep well?

12:15.080 --> 12:15.790
Not bad.

12:16.150 --> 12:17.280
I'm just a bit bored.

12:20.170 --> 12:21.750
Why did you get a wheelchair?

12:21.750 --> 12:24.200
I knew you couldn't stay still
in the ward.

12:24.930 --> 12:26.260
Check out your new ride.

12:28.500 --> 12:30.740
Want me to take you
downstairs for some fresh air?

12:30.740 --> 12:31.200
Really?

12:36.000 --> 12:38.600
But the nurse said
I still need an IV drip later.

12:39.220 --> 12:41.080
The doctor probably won't agree.

12:43.320 --> 12:44.650
Just for a little while.

12:45.260 --> 12:46.260
It should be fine.

12:51.470 --> 12:55.530
[Inpatient]

12:52.100 --> 12:54.700
I wonder how long it will take
for my leg to heal.

12:55.080 --> 12:57.010
I really want to go skateboarding.

12:58.910 --> 13:00.240
You want to skateboard?

13:01.550 --> 13:03.280
I like the feeling of freedom

13:03.630 --> 13:04.960
with the wind in my face.

13:07.500 --> 13:09.160
You can feel it right now, too.

13:09.670 --> 13:10.270
Sit tight.

13:11.580 --> 13:12.410
Here we go!

13:17.120 --> 13:18.460
Flying!

13:19.130 --> 13:19.730
Drifting!

13:21.470 --> 13:22.050
Charge!

13:45.870 --> 13:46.530
Lin Zhixia!

13:51.770 --> 13:52.830
What are you doing?

13:52.980 --> 13:53.780
Are you crazy?

13:54.980 --> 13:55.950
Trying to fly?

13:57.490 --> 13:58.440
The readings?

13:58.700 --> 13:59.580
Systolic 110,

13:59.580 --> 14:00.440
diastolic 75.

14:03.270 --> 14:05.220
Tell me why I saw Dr. Shen's girlfriend

14:05.220 --> 14:06.820
hanging out with another man

14:06.890 --> 14:08.530
and having a great time?

14:08.770 --> 14:09.690
I don't know.

14:10.210 --> 14:13.410
I heard he was waiting at
the ward door early in the morning,

14:13.410 --> 14:15.040
even earlier than Dr. Shen.

14:15.820 --> 14:16.820
Wait, then what about Dr. Shen?

14:16.820 --> 14:19.170
What nonsense are you talking about?

14:19.850 --> 14:22.500
That lady can't be Dr. Shen's girlfriend.

14:23.010 --> 14:23.980
No way.

14:24.440 --> 14:26.430
I heard that when people asked Dr. Shen,

14:26.430 --> 14:27.890
he didn't deny it himself.

14:28.200 --> 14:29.730
Did he admit it personally?

14:31.150 --> 14:32.380
Not exactly.

14:33.620 --> 14:34.630
There you have it.

15:05.560 --> 15:06.440
Jiang Yubai.

15:06.800 --> 15:08.620
When did your IQ get so low?

15:13.320 --> 15:14.120
How childish!

15:14.320 --> 15:16.770
[Inpatient]

15:14.960 --> 15:16.820
What's so fun about a wheelchair?

15:18.030 --> 15:19.510
Zeqiu, it was my idea.

15:19.620 --> 15:21.080
Where did all your smarts go?

15:21.080 --> 15:22.340
What if you fall again?

15:22.650 --> 15:23.720
Don't you want your leg?

15:23.720 --> 15:25.650
Want to be in a wheelchair for life?

15:28.080 --> 15:29.280
Stop fooling around.

15:30.600 --> 15:31.060
Go back!

15:35.750 --> 15:38.500
[Inpatient]

15:39.600 --> 15:41.710
With a combined IQ of almost 400,

15:42.000 --> 15:43.130
you chose to do this.

15:43.690 --> 15:45.290
Is this what adults would do?

15:46.010 --> 15:46.740
So childish.

15:50.700 --> 15:51.840
Instead of cooking her something good,

15:51.840 --> 15:53.970
you pushed her around in a wheelchair.

16:16.340 --> 16:17.100
Dr. Shen.

16:19.730 --> 16:20.530
What's wrong?

16:23.650 --> 16:25.190
Are you in a bad mood?

16:28.710 --> 16:29.840
Come on, breathe in.

16:34.940 --> 16:35.670
Breathe out.

16:39.480 --> 16:40.100
I'm not.

16:41.420 --> 16:42.730
Don't lie to me.

16:43.280 --> 16:45.650
You went to the orthopedics
department first thing in the morning,

16:45.650 --> 16:47.280
and someone else did my checkup.

16:47.280 --> 16:47.740
What?

16:48.610 --> 16:50.700
Are you not going to
take care of me anymore?

16:50.700 --> 16:51.360
Breathe in.

16:54.530 --> 16:55.260
Breathe out.

16:58.170 --> 16:58.650
No.

17:02.750 --> 17:03.610
Who's that guy?

17:06.420 --> 17:07.020
Which one?

17:07.569 --> 17:09.010
The tall, handsome one

17:09.770 --> 17:11.700
playing with Zhixia in the garden.

17:13.510 --> 17:14.310
Why do you ask?

17:16.569 --> 17:17.900
Is he your rival in love?

17:23.700 --> 17:24.790
What's going on

17:25.970 --> 17:27.920
in that little head of yours all day?

17:27.920 --> 17:28.910
Gossip.

17:29.740 --> 17:31.250
Otherwise, it's so boring.

17:31.250 --> 17:32.870
People only started spreading rumors
yesterday

17:32.870 --> 17:34.420
that Zhixia is your girlfriend.

17:34.420 --> 17:36.450
And today, he made such a big scene

17:36.470 --> 17:38.270
like he wanted everyone to know.

17:38.880 --> 17:41.230
You two peacocks are really

17:41.530 --> 17:43.530
showing off your courtship skills.

17:45.860 --> 17:46.810
You know it all.

17:48.610 --> 17:49.810
Then in your opinion,

17:50.240 --> 17:51.570
who is better, him or me?

17:52.420 --> 17:54.520
Of course he is...

17:56.700 --> 17:57.700
Not as good as you.

18:02.350 --> 18:03.350
You're young,

18:03.630 --> 18:05.480
but you're quite good at flattery.

18:05.480 --> 18:06.540
It's not flattery.

18:15.500 --> 18:16.980
Have a glass of water first.

18:16.980 --> 18:18.100
I'll go wash the vegetables.

18:18.100 --> 18:18.850
Make yourself at home.

18:18.850 --> 18:19.270
Okay.

18:34.800 --> 18:37.290
[Astronomy Enthusiast]

18:42.640 --> 18:44.240
That's the Winter Triangle.

18:45.220 --> 18:46.620
Next to it is the Hexagon.

18:47.030 --> 18:49.440
Among them, Sirius, the closest one to us,

18:49.590 --> 18:51.050
is slowly approaching us.

18:53.050 --> 18:54.850
Why did the meteors stop moving?

18:55.180 --> 18:56.640
Weren't you making a wish?

18:56.790 --> 18:57.850
I paused it for you.

19:24.530 --> 19:25.660
Do you need any help?

19:26.510 --> 19:28.010
No, I can do it myself.

19:28.830 --> 19:29.790
Just make yourself comfortable

19:29.790 --> 19:30.660
and wait to eat.

19:34.350 --> 19:34.950
By the way,

19:35.160 --> 19:36.940
did you check on
Lin Zhixia this afternoon?

19:36.940 --> 19:38.200
Is she feeling better?

19:39.160 --> 19:41.200
It makes me mad just talking about it.

19:41.200 --> 19:42.800
Jiang Yubai is also an idiot.

19:43.030 --> 19:44.140
He took Lin Zhixia downstairs

19:44.140 --> 19:47.000
in a wheelchair and pushed her
around like a maniac.

19:47.830 --> 19:49.660
That means she's probably fine now.

19:49.660 --> 19:50.240
If something goes wrong again,

19:50.240 --> 19:52.370
I won't be able to answer
to my parents.

19:52.720 --> 19:53.920
They're like two kids.

19:53.920 --> 19:56.050
Neither of them gives me peace of mind.

19:56.160 --> 19:56.620
Oh yeah,

19:56.980 --> 19:58.240
weren't you classmates with Jiang Yubai

19:58.240 --> 19:59.740
and Shen Fuxuan?

20:01.440 --> 20:02.440
The two of them...

20:03.880 --> 20:04.770
How should I put it?

20:04.770 --> 20:05.700
They're a bit...

20:06.140 --> 20:07.370
A bit weird.

20:09.050 --> 20:10.380
What's wrong with them?

20:10.890 --> 20:13.150
They're acting weird towards my sister.

20:14.790 --> 20:16.790
I thought it was some breaking news.

20:16.920 --> 20:18.240
They've been like this
since they were kids.

20:18.240 --> 20:20.700
Isn't this something
the whole world knows?

20:20.900 --> 20:21.380
Really?

20:24.920 --> 20:26.120
If it were you,

20:27.000 --> 20:28.930
who would you choose between them?

20:29.310 --> 20:30.770
I wouldn't choose either.

20:32.720 --> 20:34.380
You have such high standards.

20:36.130 --> 20:38.010
I like mature ones.

20:41.940 --> 20:42.800
Are you picking

20:43.510 --> 20:45.310
a brother-in-law for yourself?

20:46.830 --> 20:49.500
Actually, as long as Lin Zhixia
likes him and he suits her,

20:49.500 --> 20:50.230
I don't mind.

20:53.330 --> 20:55.740
But Lin Zhixia's logical thinking

20:55.770 --> 20:57.430
is quite different from ours.

20:57.730 --> 20:59.330
How do you know who suits her?

20:59.500 --> 21:01.020
I know my sister well.

21:02.440 --> 21:05.360
I plan to give them the same question

21:05.840 --> 21:07.370
without a standard answer.

21:09.010 --> 21:10.140
When the time comes,

21:10.220 --> 21:12.680
it's up to Lin Zhixia
to choose between them.

21:14.270 --> 21:16.990
A screening test from the brother-in-law.

21:17.550 --> 21:18.350
It's not easy.

21:22.440 --> 21:23.640
By the way, Lin Zeqiu,

21:24.140 --> 21:25.740
let's take a photo together.

21:27.050 --> 21:28.660
As proof for your parents.

21:32.850 --> 21:33.180
Okay.

21:37.180 --> 21:38.030
Right here.

21:38.090 --> 21:38.500
Okay.

21:39.090 --> 21:40.700
Three, two, one.

21:46.770 --> 21:48.360
We don't look very close.

21:49.200 --> 21:50.540
Let's take another one.

21:50.790 --> 21:51.510
Get a little closer.

21:51.510 --> 21:51.940
Okay.

21:57.010 --> 21:58.310
Three, two, one.

22:01.010 --> 22:01.610
All right.

22:02.810 --> 22:03.410
Thank you.

22:04.160 --> 22:05.160
Have a seat first,

22:05.200 --> 22:06.530
food will be ready soon.

22:18.050 --> 22:18.580
How is it?

22:21.550 --> 22:22.480
It's delicious.

22:23.960 --> 22:25.110
Eat more if it's good.

22:25.110 --> 22:28.310
Eating school cafeteria food
all the time must be boring.

22:31.350 --> 22:33.150
Don't just watch me, you eat too.

22:34.880 --> 22:36.760
Right, I'll eat.

22:38.700 --> 22:41.230
I just saw a lot of
astronomy books on the desk.

22:41.360 --> 22:43.830
That you've kept this hobby
for so many years,

22:43.830 --> 22:44.960
I really admire you.

22:47.010 --> 22:48.350
Besides working every day,

22:48.350 --> 22:49.810
this is my only hobby left.

22:52.440 --> 22:54.240
I don't seem to have any hobbies.

22:54.790 --> 22:56.320
I'm a pretty boring person.

22:58.000 --> 22:58.800
Not at all.

22:58.830 --> 23:00.760
I think you're quite interesting.

23:00.900 --> 23:02.630
You're so good at your studies.

23:03.290 --> 23:04.880
I remember you sing very well, too.

23:04.880 --> 23:05.640
Right?

23:12.180 --> 23:12.980
Tell me,

23:13.180 --> 23:15.910
what do you think about
when you look at the stars?

23:20.310 --> 23:21.960
It makes me feel very small.

23:24.920 --> 23:26.580
Only when I look up at the stars

23:28.000 --> 23:29.920
can I find a moment of freedom.

23:32.150 --> 23:34.200
Aren't you free now?

23:36.680 --> 23:38.810
I think freedom is actually relative.

23:40.550 --> 23:42.680
Living in this society, we are bound by

23:43.030 --> 23:44.510
work, family,

23:44.510 --> 23:45.680
and social status.

23:45.830 --> 23:47.510
These things make us more or less

23:47.510 --> 23:49.370
connected with people around us.

23:52.070 --> 23:53.160
Just like stars.

23:54.350 --> 23:55.720
Actually, every star in the sky

23:55.720 --> 23:56.880
has its own orbit,

23:58.000 --> 23:59.440
but it also connects with

23:59.440 --> 24:00.550
all the stars around it

24:00.550 --> 24:02.610
to finally form the whole starry sky.

24:09.380 --> 24:10.330
Actually, I know

24:11.090 --> 24:13.350
you've always wanted to be independent.

24:14.850 --> 24:17.290
But only after you truly

24:17.290 --> 24:19.890
build connections
with the people around you,

24:20.570 --> 24:22.230
can you find your own freedom.

24:25.980 --> 24:26.900
I also hope

24:27.700 --> 24:29.430
I can become independent soon.

24:30.420 --> 24:32.420
You are very independent by nature.

24:37.900 --> 24:39.700
You have your own thoughts and opinions

24:39.700 --> 24:40.740
and never just follow the crowd.

24:40.740 --> 24:41.610
You do well in your studies,

24:41.610 --> 24:43.980
and are taking your favorite major
at a top university.

24:43.980 --> 24:46.640
You will definitely achieve
whatever you want.

24:47.980 --> 24:49.310
Everything you hope for

24:49.610 --> 24:50.940
is just a matter of time.

24:59.770 --> 25:01.100
I also want to thank you.

25:02.380 --> 25:03.380
Thank me for what?

25:04.140 --> 25:06.540
For helping me keep things
from my parents.

25:08.010 --> 25:09.500
You did me a huge favor.

25:11.810 --> 25:13.570
If you encounter any problems
in the future,

25:13.570 --> 25:14.970
you can always come to me.

25:16.420 --> 25:17.290
You said it.

25:18.810 --> 25:19.610
I did.

25:26.810 --> 25:27.530
Cheers.

25:35.050 --> 25:36.110
This is delicious.

25:40.780 --> 25:42.570
[Inpatient]

25:56.460 --> 25:58.610
It's time. You should go to sleep.

26:00.420 --> 26:02.220
I was too soft-hearted
to scold you last night,

26:02.220 --> 26:04.820
but don't stay up so late
looking at your phone.

26:04.940 --> 26:07.140
Dr. Shen, it's not that
I don't want to sleep,

26:07.140 --> 26:08.220
I really can't.

26:11.500 --> 26:12.700
You have two choices.

26:13.590 --> 26:14.420
One,

26:14.790 --> 26:16.450
turn off your phone and sleep.

26:16.720 --> 26:17.530
Two,

26:18.140 --> 26:20.540
let me prescribe
a sleep injection for you.

26:21.810 --> 26:23.270
I don't want an injection.

26:34.510 --> 26:35.510
You should go too.

26:47.930 --> 26:50.250
I got a pair of sleep-aid
earphones for you.

26:50.250 --> 26:51.750
I've downloaded some music in it.

26:51.750 --> 26:53.880
You can listen to it if you can't sleep.

26:54.680 --> 26:55.280
Thank you.

26:56.940 --> 26:57.700
I'm leaving.

27:05.090 --> 27:05.940
Rest early.

28:09.070 --> 28:09.740
Shen.

28:10.200 --> 28:10.510
Director.

28:10.510 --> 28:11.770
Go check on Shui.

28:12.140 --> 28:13.200
She's in a bad mood.

28:24.980 --> 28:27.140
I don't want to do the check-up anymore.

28:27.140 --> 28:28.850
I do it every single day.

28:29.010 --> 28:29.900
I'm tired.

28:45.000 --> 28:46.180
What is this?

28:46.440 --> 28:47.640
Are you coaxing a kid?

28:48.610 --> 28:50.610
I'll give it to you after the check-up.

28:50.610 --> 28:52.250
I don't even like pink.

28:55.400 --> 28:56.400
What about these?

28:58.150 --> 28:59.210
Pick for yourself.

28:59.510 --> 29:01.040
See if there's any you like.

29:05.850 --> 29:06.910
How many can I pick?

29:07.030 --> 29:08.080
One per check-up.

29:09.290 --> 29:10.410
Stingy.

29:12.070 --> 29:13.730
Then I must choose carefully.

29:18.200 --> 29:19.600
I'll take the lychee one.

29:21.220 --> 29:21.740
Wait,

29:21.810 --> 29:23.810
besides the daily check-ups,

29:23.980 --> 29:25.640
if I cooperate with the blood test

29:25.640 --> 29:26.570
and eat my meals,

29:26.570 --> 29:27.940
can I get one for each of those too?

29:27.940 --> 29:28.440
Yes.

29:30.510 --> 29:32.250
Come, sit up straight.

29:32.940 --> 29:33.700
Inhale.

29:36.940 --> 29:37.800
Exhale slowly.

29:46.700 --> 29:48.420
If I'm well-behaved on 10 occasions,

29:48.420 --> 29:50.080
can I exchange them for a wish?

29:50.880 --> 29:51.500
No.

29:53.180 --> 29:54.580
What about 30 occasions?

29:55.770 --> 29:57.640
Thirty occasions should do, right?

29:57.640 --> 29:58.620
I promise

29:58.700 --> 30:01.290
I will cooperate
with all the check-ups from now on.

30:01.290 --> 30:02.490
Please?

30:02.510 --> 30:03.710
Don't push your luck.

30:07.850 --> 30:10.180
Whatever, I'll take the lychee one first.

30:10.480 --> 30:12.610
Next time, I'll get the blueberry one.

30:19.790 --> 30:21.520
I'll be making rounds tonight.

30:21.590 --> 30:23.920
If you finish
that bottle of water by then,

30:25.180 --> 30:27.040
I'll reward you with another one.

30:33.740 --> 30:36.290
Come on, Shui,
let's draw some blood first.

30:39.590 --> 30:41.120
What's the meaning of this?

30:42.480 --> 30:44.010
This endorsement contract

30:44.070 --> 30:45.240
is waiting for your signature.

30:45.240 --> 30:46.850
Of course I know
it's an endorsement contract!

30:46.850 --> 30:47.770
I'm not blind.

30:48.510 --> 30:49.530
I just want to ask you

30:49.530 --> 30:51.790
why you won't hire Zhou Heng for 800,000,

30:51.900 --> 30:53.090
but insist on spending 1.2 million

30:53.090 --> 30:55.220
to hire some star for the endorsement?

30:55.500 --> 30:56.220
What else?

30:56.850 --> 30:58.420
Nowadays, every brand's technology,

30:58.420 --> 31:00.700
car models, and colors
are almost the same.

31:00.700 --> 31:03.560
The only thing we can compete on
is brand awareness.

31:04.440 --> 31:06.250
This star just started gaining fame.

31:06.250 --> 31:06.900
I'm telling you,

31:06.900 --> 31:08.940
I managed to negotiate a low price
with great difficulty.

31:08.940 --> 31:09.750
If you don't grab them now,

31:09.750 --> 31:12.210
it won't be this price
once they're popular.

31:12.250 --> 31:13.330
Sign it quickly.

31:13.740 --> 31:14.720
Don't ruin it.

31:20.290 --> 31:21.050
Fine.

31:22.030 --> 31:22.940
I can sign.

31:24.500 --> 31:26.500
But Zhou Heng must join the company.

31:31.070 --> 31:32.600
That's a different matter.

31:33.310 --> 31:34.010
He

31:34.500 --> 31:35.830
is really too expensive.

31:35.830 --> 31:36.500
Okay.

31:37.220 --> 31:38.940
Then let's follow the procedure

31:38.940 --> 31:41.200
and let the board of directors vote on it.

31:42.440 --> 31:43.090
Duan.

31:43.310 --> 31:44.640
For such a small matter,

31:44.750 --> 31:46.610
there's no need to make a big fuss.

31:47.140 --> 31:48.140
Besides,

31:48.440 --> 31:49.770
even if we vote,

31:50.440 --> 31:52.050
the result will be the same.

31:56.090 --> 31:56.770
Really?

31:57.570 --> 31:58.420
I don't buy it.

31:59.000 --> 32:00.860
How would we know without voting?

32:01.590 --> 32:03.010
If the voting result

32:03.010 --> 32:03.980
is as you said,

32:04.250 --> 32:05.250
I'll accept it.

32:07.060 --> 32:10.010
[Inpatient]

32:14.420 --> 32:15.140
Zeqiu.

32:16.680 --> 32:18.410
I was just about to call for you.

32:18.960 --> 32:21.290
The doctor has looked at Zhixia's X-rays.

32:21.640 --> 32:23.040
It's healing quite well.

32:23.160 --> 32:25.380
She should be able to go home
and rest in a couple of days.

32:25.380 --> 32:26.090
Really?

32:32.000 --> 32:33.250
Thanks for your hard work recently.

32:33.250 --> 32:34.510
You did so much for her.

32:34.980 --> 32:36.140
After she's discharged,

32:36.140 --> 32:38.310
Lin Zhixia and I will treat you to a meal.

32:38.310 --> 32:39.240
You're welcome.

32:43.640 --> 32:45.640
Even though she's getting discharged soon,

32:45.640 --> 32:46.810
I'm still worried.

32:48.480 --> 32:49.280
What's wrong?

32:50.740 --> 32:52.400
The fundamental problem
hasn't been solved.

32:52.400 --> 32:55.070
She's still under a lot of pressure
on this project.

32:55.070 --> 32:57.740
Both manpower
and resources are insufficient.

32:58.110 --> 33:01.370
I'm afraid she'll ruin her health again
when she goes back.

33:01.510 --> 33:03.170
I can't be of much help either.

33:06.240 --> 33:07.100
How about this?

33:07.350 --> 33:09.280
I'll go back and ask my mom tonight.

33:09.550 --> 33:10.420
I'll see

33:10.510 --> 33:11.420
if I can borrow

33:11.420 --> 33:13.880
two of her students
to help with the project.

33:14.010 --> 33:14.850
Borrow?

33:15.740 --> 33:16.670
Is that allowed?

33:19.330 --> 33:20.990
It shouldn't be a big problem.

33:23.350 --> 33:25.140
That would be great if it works.

33:25.160 --> 33:26.760
You're doing me a huge favor.

33:27.700 --> 33:29.770
I'll owe you another meal.

33:29.900 --> 33:30.850
We'll talk about

33:30.850 --> 33:32.110
what you want to eat later.

33:32.110 --> 33:32.810
Sure.

33:37.980 --> 33:38.610
Zeqiu.

33:38.920 --> 33:40.500
I'm going to get some food for Lin Zhixia.

33:40.500 --> 33:42.140
Do you want something to eat, too?

33:42.140 --> 33:43.500
I've already eaten. No need.

33:43.500 --> 33:45.160
Thanks for your hard work lately.

33:45.160 --> 33:46.940
I just talked to Shen Fuxuan.

33:46.960 --> 33:49.420
He said Lin Zhixia
can be discharged the day after tomorrow.

33:49.420 --> 33:50.220
That's great.

33:51.440 --> 33:53.240
I happen to be free
tomorrow and the day after.

33:53.240 --> 33:54.420
I can take care of her.

33:54.420 --> 33:56.020
You should get some rest too.

33:56.900 --> 33:57.660
Okay.

33:59.700 --> 34:00.380
Actually,

34:00.700 --> 34:03.430
I'm still quite worried
about her work right now.

34:03.440 --> 34:05.980
Her work pressure was already high before,

34:06.050 --> 34:07.310
and now she's injured.

34:08.110 --> 34:08.940
You also know

34:09.440 --> 34:11.230
that someone
has been targeting her recently.

34:11.230 --> 34:12.690
I was wondering if

34:12.690 --> 34:14.340
we could help her with this.

34:21.820 --> 34:22.460
Zeqiu.

34:23.440 --> 34:24.570
Actually, you should know Lin Zhixia

34:24.570 --> 34:25.969
better than anyone else.

34:26.920 --> 34:28.820
She is actually more independent

34:29.280 --> 34:30.690
and resilient than we imagine.

34:30.690 --> 34:31.860
She also knows better how to handle

34:31.860 --> 34:33.860
matters in her professional field.

34:34.090 --> 34:36.290
She was just a bit flustered a while ago,

34:36.690 --> 34:38.420
so what she needs most is rest

34:38.860 --> 34:40.690
to adjust her state and pace.

34:42.530 --> 34:43.860
If she and her team didn't

34:43.860 --> 34:45.940
achieve victory on their own in the end,

34:45.940 --> 34:48.070
it wouldn't be the outcome she wanted.

34:50.420 --> 34:52.199
So all we have to do is trust her,

34:52.690 --> 34:53.590
support her,

34:54.030 --> 34:55.830
and take good care of her health.

35:34.230 --> 35:35.630
Tang, what are you doing?

35:35.900 --> 35:37.190
Want to have some supper?

35:37.190 --> 35:38.900
Hot pot or barbecue, your pick.

35:38.900 --> 35:39.820
It's my treat.

35:40.340 --> 35:42.340
I'm in urgent need of a supper buddy.

36:37.940 --> 36:39.760
Sorry, we're closed.

36:41.300 --> 36:43.100
Then I'll come back another day.

36:44.830 --> 36:45.720
It's you.

36:46.550 --> 36:47.210
Have a seat.

36:48.050 --> 36:49.460
No, it's okay. I'll go look elsewhere.

36:49.460 --> 36:50.990
I'm not that hungry anyway.

36:51.530 --> 36:53.030
I'll go see what I can whip up.

36:53.030 --> 36:54.050
Please don't trouble yourself.

36:54.050 --> 36:56.170
I'm really not that hungry.
No need to trouble yourself.

36:56.170 --> 36:58.830
Grab whatever you want to drink
from the fridge.

37:02.510 --> 37:03.280
Okay.

37:09.130 --> 37:10.340
You worked so late,

37:10.340 --> 37:12.070
you didn't have dinner, right?

37:13.670 --> 37:15.530
I was thinking of having supper,

37:15.530 --> 37:16.990
but I had no one to eat with.

37:17.090 --> 37:19.940
Next time you work overtime,
you can order food from me.

37:19.940 --> 37:21.400
Didn't you say before that

37:21.610 --> 37:24.110
people who aren't enthusiastic
about eating are not right in the head?

37:24.110 --> 37:26.770
No matter how busy you are,
you still have to eat.

37:27.130 --> 37:28.460
You even remember that?

37:29.800 --> 37:32.460
Boss, it's all thanks to you today.

37:32.860 --> 37:34.530
If you hadn't taken me in,

37:34.630 --> 37:37.690
I would be eating instant noodles
and gnawing on bread.

37:39.690 --> 37:40.890
My name is Gao Yiyuan.

37:40.920 --> 37:42.320
You can call me Yuanyuan.

37:45.170 --> 37:45.910
I said,

37:46.170 --> 37:47.380
my name is Gao Yiyuan.

37:47.780 --> 37:49.180
You can call me Yuanyuan.

38:00.260 --> 38:01.260
This is all that's left.

38:01.260 --> 38:03.120
Make do with it. It's on the house.

38:03.400 --> 38:03.990
Thanks.

38:10.340 --> 38:13.810
[Tang Tingting]

38:10.420 --> 38:12.590
Bro, I'm already swamped,

38:12.590 --> 38:14.050
and you want me to join you for supper?

38:14.050 --> 38:15.780
I'm already full on suffering.

38:20.800 --> 38:22.150
I ordered some takeout for you.

38:22.150 --> 38:23.420
It'll be left at your door in a bit.

38:23.420 --> 38:25.320
I'll allow you to eat alone today.

38:46.670 --> 38:47.840
Bro, you're back.

38:55.760 --> 38:56.480
You're out.

38:57.440 --> 38:58.670
Yes, just got out.

38:59.190 --> 38:59.990
Master Jiang,

39:00.130 --> 39:02.500
I called you so many times,
but you didn't answer.

39:02.500 --> 39:04.360
So I had to wait for you at the door.

39:04.920 --> 39:05.590
How about

39:05.760 --> 39:06.760
we go grab a drink?

39:06.800 --> 39:07.550
No need.

39:08.780 --> 39:10.040
Just tell me what it is.

39:13.730 --> 39:14.530
Master Jiang,

39:15.090 --> 39:16.090
here's the thing.

39:16.300 --> 39:17.630
I just got a big order,

39:17.630 --> 39:18.920
but the demand is difficult to meet.

39:18.920 --> 39:19.760
So...

39:23.110 --> 39:24.510
The client contact list.

39:25.030 --> 39:25.760
Give it to me.

39:27.840 --> 39:28.840
The contact list?

39:29.820 --> 39:30.750
What do you mean?

39:37.940 --> 39:39.920
Master Jiang, I was wrong.

39:40.440 --> 39:42.020
I didn't expect this to happen.

39:42.020 --> 39:43.980
If I knew they were selling fake goods,

39:43.980 --> 39:46.840
I wouldn't have taken the job
even if they killed me.

39:50.070 --> 39:50.380
I...

39:51.730 --> 39:53.420
I saw you were in a hurry for money,

39:53.420 --> 39:55.220
and I was just trying to help you.

39:56.260 --> 39:57.070
I know.

39:57.840 --> 39:59.570
This has nothing to do with you.

39:59.940 --> 40:02.200
That's why I'm willing to talk to you now.

40:02.320 --> 40:04.180
You've known me for so many years.

40:05.030 --> 40:06.090
I won't do it again.

40:06.590 --> 40:08.320
Please give me another chance.

40:09.380 --> 40:12.510
You uploaded the video
of the shock diamond, didn't you?

40:13.710 --> 40:14.770
The shock diamond?

40:31.510 --> 40:33.370
I don't know anything about that.

40:33.550 --> 40:35.680
I checked the IP address of the upload.

40:39.900 --> 40:42.010
I just thought it was so amazing.

40:42.870 --> 40:44.420
I wanted to use it to drive traffic

40:44.420 --> 40:45.880
and promote our business.

40:46.460 --> 40:47.090
Look.

40:49.000 --> 40:51.590
The private messages in this account
are all from new clients.

40:51.590 --> 40:53.990
The big batch of orders
I just told you about

40:54.030 --> 40:55.760
all came from this new channel.

40:56.960 --> 40:57.780
Don't worry.

40:58.050 --> 41:00.150
I know you don't like to show your face.

41:00.150 --> 41:01.550
No one will know it's you.

41:10.210 --> 41:10.900
Cheng,

41:12.690 --> 41:14.090
thanks for your hard work

41:14.480 --> 41:15.410
all these years.

41:18.300 --> 41:20.160
But I have my own plans from now on.

41:20.340 --> 41:21.270
Our partnership

41:22.400 --> 41:23.340
ends here.

41:30.900 --> 41:32.430
I understand what you mean.

41:33.210 --> 41:34.940
I can give you the contact list.

41:35.090 --> 41:35.980
But please,

41:36.690 --> 41:38.020
do one last thing for me.

41:38.480 --> 41:40.410
You must help me finish this order.

41:40.710 --> 41:42.570
I still have to deliver the goods.

41:42.590 --> 41:44.550
That workload will take
at least half a month.

41:44.550 --> 41:46.010
I don't have time
to waste on that right now.

41:46.010 --> 41:47.650
But I really can't afford
to compensate for it.

41:47.650 --> 41:48.690
If this order falls through,

41:48.690 --> 41:49.500
on top of the previous fines,

41:49.500 --> 41:51.760
all my work over the past two years
will have been for nothing.

41:51.760 --> 41:53.020
Please, Master Jiang.

41:57.360 --> 41:58.560
I'm begging you, bro.

41:58.760 --> 41:59.570
Please.

42:04.360 --> 42:05.630
Give me the contact list,

42:05.630 --> 42:06.430
and I'll do it.

42:12.340 --> 42:12.670
Okay.

42:23.710 --> 42:26.360
I'll leave you to it.
I won't bother you anymore.

42:26.360 --> 42:27.050
Wait.

42:31.260 --> 42:32.190
Take your stuff.

42:35.440 --> 42:36.210
Don't come

42:37.960 --> 42:39.290
looking for me anymore.

43:00.990 --> 43:05.240
[Huacheng City Hejia Hospital]

43:01.960 --> 43:03.890
You picked the candidates so fast.

43:03.900 --> 43:04.900
So efficient.

43:06.360 --> 43:08.460
Both of them are top students
from the math department.

43:08.460 --> 43:09.570
When Zhixia is discharged
from the hospital,

43:09.570 --> 43:11.230
they can come help right away.

43:11.630 --> 43:13.130
Thank Professor Shen for me.

43:13.130 --> 43:18.990
[Huacheng City Hejia Hospital]

43:13.260 --> 43:13.690
Okay.

43:13.860 --> 43:14.590
I'm leaving.

43:18.000 --> 43:19.460
Your leg is almost healed.

43:20.190 --> 43:22.790
What are you going to do
with your math project?

43:22.860 --> 43:25.000
Luo Ying has been covering
for me for days.

43:25.000 --> 43:26.760
For the remaining important calculations,

43:26.760 --> 43:28.260
I have to go back to school
and handle them myself.

43:28.260 --> 43:29.060
What's wrong?

43:30.860 --> 43:33.860
Shen Fuxuan borrowed
two math Ph.D. students

43:34.340 --> 43:35.610
from his mom

43:36.050 --> 43:37.130
to help you sort things out together.

43:37.130 --> 43:38.730
Take a look at their resumes.

43:41.150 --> 43:41.900
No need.

43:43.210 --> 43:44.670
What do you mean "no need"?

43:48.010 --> 43:50.410
How can we bother
Professor Shen with this?

43:50.880 --> 43:52.090
Isn't this cheating?

43:53.400 --> 43:55.190
If I don't even have confidence

43:55.190 --> 43:56.010
in my own team members

43:56.010 --> 43:57.150
and have to ask for external help,

43:57.150 --> 43:59.350
what would they think if they found out?

44:00.510 --> 44:02.210
I know what I'm doing.

44:02.550 --> 44:04.060
Just stop worrying, okay?

44:05.550 --> 44:06.300
Alright.

44:10.210 --> 44:11.050
This guy...

44:11.050 --> 44:12.340
He's not just a guy,

44:12.690 --> 44:13.750
he's a mind reader.

44:13.900 --> 44:14.830
What did you say?

44:15.500 --> 44:17.530
Nothing. Your choice is my choice.

44:19.630 --> 44:21.170
Can you talk normally?

44:24.300 --> 44:26.030
Just eat. I have nothing to say.

44:30.690 --> 44:31.610
Weirdo.

44:55.340 --> 44:56.270
Why are you here?

44:57.170 --> 44:58.030
This is for you.

44:58.840 --> 45:00.460
Come to my house for dinner tonight.

45:00.460 --> 45:02.280
My grandparents came back from abroad.

45:02.280 --> 45:03.480
They want to meet you.

45:04.400 --> 45:05.050
Me?

45:05.710 --> 45:07.210
You have quite the influence.

45:07.210 --> 45:07.900
They usually

45:07.900 --> 45:09.230
don't come back easily.

45:11.900 --> 45:12.730
Um, I'm sorry.

45:12.730 --> 45:14.210
I suddenly have an emergency today.

45:14.210 --> 45:15.050
Let's talk about it next time.

45:15.050 --> 45:16.380
Thanks for the flowers.

45:18.630 --> 45:20.360
I'll contact you tonight then.

45:32.380 --> 45:32.860
Hello?

45:33.230 --> 45:33.940
Hello, Mom.

45:35.280 --> 45:37.080
Did you give my address to Li Zhe?

45:37.150 --> 45:37.950
What's wrong?

45:38.300 --> 45:39.380
You didn't reply
to his WeChat messages.

45:39.380 --> 45:40.260
If I didn't tell him,

45:40.260 --> 45:41.590
where would he find you?

45:41.900 --> 45:43.050
He told you, right?

45:43.050 --> 45:44.630
To go to his house for dinner tonight.

45:44.630 --> 45:45.530
I'm not going.

45:46.630 --> 45:48.130
Mom, didn't you want me
to focus on studies before?

45:48.130 --> 45:49.930
Why are you asking me to date now?

45:50.000 --> 45:52.780
Baihui, your dad and I have discussed it.

45:53.260 --> 45:55.860
You should do what's appropriate
for your stage in life.

45:55.860 --> 45:56.780
Right now,

45:56.780 --> 45:57.900
you should be dating

45:57.900 --> 45:59.360
and then getting married.

46:01.170 --> 46:03.130
So, just like choosing a university,

46:03.130 --> 46:04.610
you've chosen my dating
and marriage partner

46:04.610 --> 46:05.650
for me, right?

46:05.960 --> 46:08.500
Your dad and I didn't say
it has to be Li Zhe.

46:09.400 --> 46:10.330
But look around.

46:10.900 --> 46:12.460
Look at the people around you.

46:12.460 --> 46:14.780
Who is more suitable than him

46:15.070 --> 46:16.000
in every aspect?

46:17.480 --> 46:18.210
Besides,

46:18.380 --> 46:19.860
what's wrong with Li Zhe?

46:20.460 --> 46:22.780
Can you just get to know him?

46:23.210 --> 46:23.940
Fine.

46:24.570 --> 46:25.460
You're right.

46:26.050 --> 46:27.170
I should be dating.

46:28.900 --> 46:30.430
I already have a boyfriend.

46:30.590 --> 46:31.520
What did you say?

46:34.550 --> 46:35.900
I said, I have a boyfriend.

46:35.900 --> 46:37.900
So I won't be going
to his place for dinner.

46:37.900 --> 46:38.670
I see.

46:39.460 --> 46:41.800
You've gotten too big for your britches,
haven't you?

46:41.800 --> 46:43.460
I'm not talking to you anymore.

46:43.460 --> 46:44.530
Let your dad talk to you.

46:44.530 --> 46:45.260
I...

46:45.400 --> 46:46.780
Hello? Mom?

47:01.900 --> 47:03.940
Jiang Yubai, it's good you're here.

47:04.930 --> 47:06.130
What's wrong, Zeqiu?

47:06.440 --> 47:08.370
I have something at work tomorrow.

47:08.890 --> 47:09.690
Can you...

47:09.690 --> 47:11.650
It's fine. I'll take care of her tomorrow.

47:11.650 --> 47:12.730
I'll pick her up from the hospital.

47:12.730 --> 47:13.650
Okay.

47:13.860 --> 47:15.060
Sorry to trouble you.

47:15.360 --> 47:17.220
Don't go fooling around with her.

47:17.280 --> 47:17.940
I got it.

47:18.360 --> 47:19.290
I'm leaving now.

47:21.150 --> 47:22.460
She can't walk right now.

47:22.460 --> 47:23.990
How are you two going to eat?

47:24.210 --> 47:25.720
-I’ll cook for her.
-We…

47:25.900 --> 47:27.030
I'll make all 3 meals

47:27.050 --> 47:28.580
and ensure a balanced diet.

47:29.860 --> 47:31.570
Then what time will you go home?

47:31.570 --> 47:32.570
What time?

47:34.300 --> 47:35.700
Don't you have to go home?

47:36.400 --> 47:37.360
Yes, I do.

47:37.480 --> 47:39.280
I'll go back after making dinner.

47:39.280 --> 47:40.340
Zeqiu...

47:40.480 --> 47:41.690
We're just chatting.

47:42.400 --> 47:43.170
Well,

47:43.190 --> 47:44.090
after you get home every day,

47:44.090 --> 47:45.690
share your location with me.

47:45.710 --> 47:46.940
Share my location?

47:48.010 --> 47:49.380
Just kidding.

47:49.380 --> 47:50.420
But do it.

47:51.710 --> 47:52.820
I'm leaving.

48:08.590 --> 48:09.300
Sorry.

48:09.880 --> 48:10.670
I kept you waiting.

48:10.670 --> 48:12.330
It's fine. I just got here too.

48:13.780 --> 48:14.860
Let's go up first.

48:14.860 --> 48:15.730
Okay, let me carry this.

48:15.730 --> 48:16.860
It's fine. I got it.

48:24.090 --> 48:25.290
You can use this half.

48:26.460 --> 48:27.190
Is it enough?

48:27.290 --> 48:27.940
Yes.

48:28.670 --> 48:30.840
I don't usually tidy up,
so it's a bit messy.

48:30.840 --> 48:31.610
It's fine.

48:31.760 --> 48:32.710
Here.

48:32.710 --> 48:34.130
I'll hang your towel here.

48:34.130 --> 48:34.860
Okay.

48:46.900 --> 48:48.500
I'll leave this side for you.

49:08.570 --> 49:09.340
Thanks.

49:10.510 --> 49:11.420
No problem.

49:12.010 --> 49:12.730
It's fine.

49:13.150 --> 49:14.900
I think this is pretty good.

49:15.760 --> 49:16.820
If my parents call,

49:16.820 --> 49:17.950
you can cover for me.

49:24.000 --> 49:26.330
Actually, you're the one covering for me.

49:28.510 --> 49:29.940
I'll tell you the truth.

49:31.150 --> 49:34.570
My parents found a boyfriend for me.

49:34.570 --> 49:35.980
They want me to get married,

49:35.980 --> 49:37.580
so they found someone for me.

49:38.000 --> 49:39.860
I really didn't know what to do,

49:39.860 --> 49:40.760
so I...

49:44.670 --> 49:45.500
It's fine.

49:46.530 --> 49:47.130
It's fine.

49:47.130 --> 49:48.170
I think it's pretty good now.

49:48.170 --> 49:49.830
We're helping each other out.

49:50.360 --> 49:52.160
Let me know if you need anything.

49:57.650 --> 49:59.170
You'll sleep in the guest room.

49:59.170 --> 50:00.500
It's already tidied up.

50:00.510 --> 50:02.370
And Lin Zhixia rarely comes back,

50:02.710 --> 50:03.690
so it works out.

50:04.380 --> 50:05.010
Okay.

50:05.010 --> 50:05.690
Right.

50:06.190 --> 50:06.980
Thanks.

50:07.000 --> 50:07.860
No problem.

50:29.500 --> 50:30.300
Wait a minute.

50:31.260 --> 50:32.130
Give it to me.

50:55.050 --> 50:56.180
I can walk by myself.

51:15.330 --> 51:17.090
I think I have a fever.

51:18.400 --> 51:19.050
A fever?

52:00.380 --> 52:01.050
No fever.

52:05.320 --> 52:07.050
During my days in the hospital,

52:07.280 --> 52:07.900
I realized that

52:07.900 --> 52:09.670
the connection between Jiang Yubai and me

52:09.670 --> 52:12.170
had surpassed the linear model of X and Y,

52:12.690 --> 52:15.090
deviating from its preset trajectory.

52:16.000 --> 52:17.930
His boundless understanding of me

52:18.300 --> 52:20.900
had become an unpredictable
random variable,

52:21.590 --> 52:22.990
making our relationship

52:23.170 --> 52:26.130
an equation
that even calculus couldn't solve.
